sentences.text:
This appeal is filed by the appellant being aggrieved of the judgment dated 20.07.2024 passed by the learned Second Additional Judge to the Court of Additional Sessions Judge, Lavkushnagar,
Distt. Chattarpur in SC/03/2020 whereby the appellant has been convicted under Section 3 read with Section 4(2) of the P.O.C.S.O. Act, 2012 and sentenced to 20 years' R.I. with fine of Rs.2,000/-;
in lieu 01 month additional R.I. Though appellant has also been convicted under Section 376(3) of I.P.C. but has not been sentenced separately.

